From: Ritesh Pandit <riteshp2001@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 15:01:38 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 140/140] release: 2.6.0 - audiobooks, servers, themes, and
 gestures

Prepare the stable mpvRx 2.6.0 release with the complete changelog since v2.5.0. Preserve the latest user-edited release heading and all historical changelog entries. Document audiobook and media-server integrations, downloads, live captions, scopes and shader presets, themes and portable wallpaper backups, library gestures, TV and display support, and reliability improvements.

Address the active song-to-video recurrence of issue #502. Classify the selected playback item before consulting native audio tracks; only use native fallback for matching ready media. Prevent an empty replacement queue from displaying the previous song's controls while retaining existing notification and stopped-session handling.

Advance the internal stable version-code band above published 2.6.0 betas while retaining versionName 2.6.0 and the existing ABI code scheme. Stable APKs can replace earlier beta builds without a downgrade.

Local verification: focused static source and release-workflow review, editor diagnostics, historical changelog preservation checks, and staged git diff --check. No local build, tests, formatter, emulator, or device playback checks were run. The requested v2.6.0 tag uses the existing GitHub workflow to build, sign, and publish release APKs.
